license text is at /app/LICENSE. This image does not grant a proprietary,
paid, or white-label license, and it does not remove upstream copyright or
license notices.

AGPL section 13 requires that users who interact with a modified copy over a
network can receive the corresponding source of that version. The
corresponding source of this image is the public commit recorded in the OCI
label org.opencontainers.image.revision. The upstream project is:

  https://github.com/gitroomhq/postiz-app

The latest published upstream release when this image line was cut is v2.25.3.
version.txt in that tag and in this tree still says v1.47.0. That file is not
the release identifier. This fork's commit, recorded in
org.opencontainers.image.revision, is the corresponding source. It is ahead
of v2.25.3. The image is built from that source. It does not extend the
official ghcr.io/gitroomhq image.

The process supervisor is deploy/fuqn/supervise.mjs in this source tree.
pm2 is not installed.

Do not strip /app/LICENSE or this notice when you republish the image.
